mode: "100644"
text: "## Description\nProvide a concise summary of the changes introduced in this pull request.\n\n## Related Issues\nFixes #(issue)\n\n## Type of Change\n- [ ] Bug fix (non-breaking change which fixes an issue)\n- [ ] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\n- [ ] Breaking change (fix or feature that would cause existing functionality to not work as expected)\n- [ ] Documentation update\n- [ ] Performance optimization\n\n## Checklist\n- [ ] Code conforms to the existing style guidelines\n- [ ] Local tests and linters pass cleanly\n- [ ] Added tests that prove fix is effective or feature works\n- [ ] Updated documentation / README accordingly\n"
